{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "7bcdcbe9-dabb-498c-ba37-181f5cb0be01",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3188",
            "content": {
                "en": "Got everything. Good thing we helped out that stall owner and that staff member earlier.",
                "zh": "东西都齐了，幸好帮了那位摊主还有那个工作人员。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7494.66650390625,
            "positionY": 184.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "951a7d83-2613-4eeb-bea0-8907af048db1",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3189",
            "content": {
                "en": "Heave-ho. I’ll leave the extinguisher here. What do we even need all this stuff for?",
                "zh": "嘿咻。灭火器我放到这里了。我们要这些东西干什么啊？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7824.0,
            "positionY": 184.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "04720d73-94e5-499f-8f94-81d75f2ba4e7",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3190",
            "content": {
                "en": "I just ran into a local puppet-maker around here. The thread he uses for his puppets is very similar to the one I saw on the plane.",
                "zh": "刚才我在周边遇到了一位本地木偶匠人，他用来制作木偶的丝线和我之前在飞机上看到的非常类似。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8141.3330078125,
            "positionY": 185.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0abbb66e-c7bb-4419-a4da-7920ebb34b11",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3191",
            "content": {
                "en": "The material is like spider silk: it melts when heated, and becomes brittle when exposed to cold.",
                "zh": "这种丝线材质类似蛛丝，遇热会融化，遇冷会脆化。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8472.0,
            "positionY": 186.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "affb42e6-7db6-462f-832f-ead73bd9f82a",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "7a570009-3eab-4a2f-b216-90c158cfb04f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3192",
            "content": {
                "en": "Right, the people had those threads implanted in their bodies!",
                "zh": "对了，那些人身体里被植入了丝线！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8801.333984375,
            "positionY": 185.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "02651c1e-be9d-46c9-9cc1-b817e9aeef45",
